      "title": "capture: init toolbar mutex each capture",
      "message": "capture: init toolbar mutex each capture\n\nA GMutex has to be initialized once for each time it is cleared, at\nleast on some platforms. It has to be cleared, at least on some platforms,\nto avoid being leaked. We have a capture_session_init but not a\ncapture_session_free because nothing else in capture_session requires\nfreeing at the program's end (but it might make sense to add one later\nrather than do initialization and cleanup when a capture starts and\nends.)\n\nFixup d596d0d6e5200543b1442035f6f8e94cb2866618\n\nFix #21505\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
